{"id": "3aed9549-ea95-40fd-822d-bfa648b72291", "notes": "Allows formulators to lower their primary preservative dose by disrupting microbial cell membranes.", "user_id": null, "function": "Solvent / Preservative Booster", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "1,2-Hexanediol", "is_cosmos": false, "cas_number": "6920-22-5", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "1,2-Hexanediol", "common_uses": "Sheet masks, toners, \"preservative-free\" claims", "description": "Multifunctional diol that acts as a humectant, emollient, and potent preservative booster.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "low", "max_usage_pct": 3.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": 10.00, "optimal_ph_min": 3.00, "physical_state": "liquid", "cosmos_compliant": false, "default_max_usage": 2.0, "default_min_usage": 1.0, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 80},
{"id": "649bbc57-3c9b-420a-9aec-9859ccb0b6dc", "notes": "Excellent stability compared to L-Ascorbic Acid; does not require extremely low pH.", "user_id": null, "function": "Active (Antioxidant)", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "3-Glyceryl Ascorbate", "is_cosmos": false, "cas_number": "1118173-53-5", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Amitose 3GA", "common_uses": "Vitamin C serums, brightening lotions", "description": "Highly stable, moisturizing vitamin C derivative.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "high", "max_usage_pct": 10.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": 6.00, "optimal_ph_min": 3.00, "physical_state": "liquid", "cosmos_compliant": false, "default_max_usage": 10, "default_min_usage": 1, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 60},
{"id": "f77f90b0-c488-4d7d-9787-f55371a7ee66", "notes": "Resists oxidation (turning brown/orange) much longer than standard Ascorbic Acid.", "user_id": null, "function": "Active (Brightening)", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "3-O-Ethyl Ascorbic Acid", "is_cosmos": false, "cas_number": "86404-04-8", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Ethyl Ascorbic Acid", "common_uses": "Daily brightening serums, toners", "description": "Highly stable, water-and-oil-soluble Vitamin C derivative. Exceptional brightening capabilities and does not require a harsh low pH.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "high", "max_usage_pct": 5.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": 6.00, "optimal_ph_min": 4.00, "physical_state": "powder", "cosmos_compliant": false, "default_max_usage": 3.0, "default_min_usage": 1.0, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 50},
{"id": "a701e77a-e039-4860-bd64-adbd25799c4e", "notes": "Dissolves slowly in cold water. Mildly anionic.", "user_id": null, "function": "Rheology Modifier", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Acacia Senegal Gum", "is_cosmos": true, "cas_number": "9000-01-5", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Gum Arabic", "common_uses": "Emulsions, hair products, masks", "description": "Natural tree gum that thickens, stabilizes emulsions and leaves a light film.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "anionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "low", "max_usage_pct": 3.00, "min_usage_pct": 0.50, "optimal_ph_max": null, "optimal_ph_min": null, "physical_state": "powder", "cosmos_compliant": true, "default_max_usage": 2, "default_min_usage": 0.5, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 80},
{"id": "04d8bc66-cdff-4d57-ad6c-a2dbc6448e0a", "notes": "Highly stable, easy to formulate, and excellent for hydration.", "user_id": null, "function": "Active", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Acetyl Glucosamine", "is_cosmos": true, "cas_number": "7512-17-6", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "N-Acetyl Glucosamine (NAG)", "common_uses": "Brightening serums, moisturizers", "description": "Amino sugar that gently exfoliates and works synergistically with niacinamide to brighten skin.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "medium", "max_usage_pct": 4.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": 8.00, "optimal_ph_min": 3.00, "physical_state": "powder", "cosmos_compliant": true, "default_max_usage": 4, "default_min_usage": 1, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 70},
{"id": "16fdfa13-f6d8-4d35-a9bd-2b7af8e1db4c", "notes": "Highly heat sensitive. Must be incorporated during the cool-down phase below 40°C. Works best in highly aqueous, fast-absorbing serums.", "user_id": null, "function": "Active (Anti-Aging)", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Acetyl Hexapeptide-8", "is_cosmos": false, "cas_number": "616204-22-9", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Argireline Peptide Solution", "common_uses": "Targeted wrinkle serums, eye creams", "description": "The famous \"Botox-in-a-bottle\" neuropeptide. Works by intercepting neurotransmitter signals to temporarily relax facial muscles and reduce dynamic wrinkles.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "high", "max_usage_pct": 10.00, "min_usage_pct": 2.00, "optimal_ph_max": 7.00, "optimal_ph_min": 4.00, "physical_state": "liquid", "cosmos_compliant": false, "default_max_usage": 10.0, "default_min_usage": 5.0, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 40},
{"id": "fc6bb9b2-640b-4ad8-b201-07cbb5929620", "notes": "A very dilute solution (about 0.1% peptide), used at 1-10% of the product as sold. Heat-sensitive: add during the cool-down, below 40°C. Evidence for its effect comes mainly from the manufacturer's own studies.", "user_id": null, "function": "Active (Anti-Aging)", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Acetyl Tetrapeptide-5", "is_cosmos": false, "cas_number": "820959-17-9", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Acetyl Tetrapeptide-5 (Eyeseryl Solution)", "common_uses": "Eye gels, eye creams, serums", "description": "Peptide designed for the eye area, to ease the look of puffiness and dark circles.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "high", "max_usage_pct": 10.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": 7.00, "optimal_ph_min": 4.00, "physical_state": "liquid", "cosmos_compliant": false, "default_max_usage": 10, "default_min_usage": 3, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 40},
{"id": "b933991d-491e-4193-916f-48a72b90ee13", "notes": "Sprinkle onto water and let it wet out, then neutralize. More electrolyte tolerant than Carbopol 940.", "user_id": null, "function": "Rheology Modifier", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer", "is_cosmos": false, "cas_number": "N/A", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "dispersible", "trade_name": "Carbopol Ultrez 20", "common_uses": "Gel creams, light emulsions, serums", "description": "Self-wetting carbomer that disperses without lumps and stabilizes emulsions at very low use levels.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "anionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "medium", "max_usage_pct": 1.00, "min_usage_pct": 0.10, "optimal_ph_max": 10.00, "optimal_ph_min": 5.00, "physical_state": "powder", "cosmos_compliant": false, "default_max_usage": 0.5, "default_min_usage": 0.2, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 90},
{"id": "87a4dbc6-14e3-4a6c-8aec-e9be0c0d13bb", "notes": "Stable enough to be used as a main oil.", "user_id": null, "function": "Carrier Oil", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Adansonia Digitata Seed Oil", "is_cosmos": true, "cas_number": "N/A", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "oil", "trade_name": "Baobab Oil", "common_uses": "Body oils, hair oils, balms, dry-skin creams", "description": "Stable, nutrient-rich oil from the African baobab tree, with a rich but fast-absorbing feel.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "medium", "max_usage_pct": 100.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": null, "optimal_ph_min": null, "physical_state": "liquid", "cosmos_compliant": true, "default_max_usage": 15, "default_min_usage": 3, "comedogenic_rating": 2, "max_heating_temp_c": 70},
{"id": "3c8e4d7b-a59a-4990-9c51-3d5a9a98baae", "notes": "Requires heat (~80°C) to dissolve properly in water. Often precipitates out if the concentration exceeds 0.2% without a co-solvent.", "user_id": null, "function": "Active (Anti-Aging)", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Adenosine", "is_cosmos": true, "cas_number": "58-61-7", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Adenosine", "common_uses": "Korean skincare formulations, anti-aging toners", "description": "Yeast-derived molecule that functions as a major energy source for cellular functions. Highly effective at smoothing wrinkles and soothing skin.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "high", "max_usage_pct": 0.50, "min_usage_pct": 0.05, "optimal_ph_max": 7.00, "optimal_ph_min": 4.00, "physical_state": "powder", "cosmos_compliant": true, "default_max_usage": 0.2, "default_min_usage": 0.1, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 80},
{"id": "00fc087b-c014-4acd-bdcf-e59faa8ff376", "notes": "Add during the cool-down. Patch test and avoid broken skin. Often combined with ivy, butcher's broom and caffeine in leg and body products. Check the supplier's COSMOS certificate if you need that claim.", "user_id": null, "function": "Active (Circulation)", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Aesculus Hippocastanum (Horse Chestnut) Seed Extract", "is_cosmos": false, "cas_number": "N/A", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Horse Chestnut Extract", "common_uses": "Leg gels, cellulite creams, eye and vein-care products", "description": "Rich in escin, a saponin traditionally used to firm skin and soothe tired, heavy legs.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "medium", "max_usage_pct": 8.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": 7.00, "optimal_ph_min": 4.00, "physical_state": "liquid", "cosmos_compliant": false, "default_max_usage": 5, "default_min_usage": 2, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 50},
{"id": "555b1187-08bb-4822-aef8-dd6dd6002c44", "notes": "Boil it for 1-2 minutes to dissolve. It sets as it cools to about 35-40°C, so work quickly.", "user_id": null, "function": "Rheology Modifier", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Agar", "is_cosmos": true, "cas_number": "9002-18-0", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Agar-Agar", "common_uses": "Gel masks, solid shampoos, jellies", "description": "Seaweed gelling agent that sets a firm, heat-stable gel.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "low", "max_usage_pct": 2.00, "min_usage_pct": 0.50, "optimal_ph_max": null, "optimal_ph_min": null, "physical_state": "powder", "cosmos_compliant": true, "default_max_usage": 1.5, "default_min_usage": 0.5, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 100},
{"id": "fa675229-e33a-4577-bcf7-ce7ea7161602", "notes": "Extremely flammable (Flash point ~13C). Denatured to prevent consumption. Can be drying to the skin in high concentrations.", "user_id": null, "function": "Solvent / Astringent", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Alcohol Denat.", "is_cosmos": true, "cas_number": "64-17-5", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Perfumers Alcohol (SDA 40B)", "common_uses": "Perfumes, hand sanitizers, gel creams", "description": "Highly volatile solvent that evaporates instantly. Drastically decreases drying time and thins out heavy formulations.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "low", "max_usage_pct": 90.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": null, "optimal_ph_min": null, "physical_state": "liquid", "cosmos_compliant": true, "default_max_usage": 20.0, "default_min_usage": 5.0, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 30},
{"id": "d06e7d15-a871-4c51-9234-3409c535fe02", "notes": "Rich in unsaturated fats, so add vitamin E and store it cool. Avoid if you have a tree-nut allergy.", "user_id": null, "function": "Carrier Oil", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Aleurites Moluccana Seed Oil", "is_cosmos": true, "cas_number": "N/A", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "oil", "trade_name": "Kukui Nut Oil", "common_uses": "Facial oils, lotions, hair care, after-sun care", "description": "Very light, fast-absorbing oil from Hawaii and the Pacific, rich in essential fatty acids.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "non-ionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "medium", "max_usage_pct": 100.00, "min_usage_pct": 1.00, "optimal_ph_max": null, "optimal_ph_min": null, "physical_state": "liquid", "cosmos_compliant": true, "default_max_usage": 15, "default_min_usage": 3, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 40},
{"id": "e364cf89-0954-4987-b4bf-04cbb6c7150c", "notes": "Hard water or calcium-rich ingredients can set it into a gel unexpectedly. Hydrate with high shear and leave it to sit.", "user_id": null, "function": "Rheology Modifier", "is_vegan": true, "inci_name": "Algin", "is_cosmos": true, "cas_number": "9005-38-3", "is_paraben": false, "is_sulfate": false, "solubility": "water", "trade_name": "Sodium Alginate", "common_uses": "Peel-off masks, gels, suspending beads", "description": "Seaweed-derived thickener. Forms a gel on contact with calcium, which makes it useful for peel-off masks and beads.", "is_silicone": false, "ionic_charge": "anionic", "is_fragrance": false, "cost_category": "medium", "max_usage_pct": 2.00, "min_usage_pct": 0.20, "optimal_ph_max": 10.00, "optimal_ph_min": 4.00, "physical_state": "powder", "cosmos_compliant": true, "default_max_usage": 1.5, "default_min_usage": 0.5, "comedogenic_rating": 0, "max_heating_temp_c": 80},
